<title>PORTUGAL: Portugal's Somague H1 cons net up sharply.</title>
<headline>Portugal's Somague H1 cons net up sharply.</headline>
<dateline>LISBON 1996-09-02</dateline>
<text>
<p>Jan 1 to June 30:</p>
<p>(billion escudos, unless stated)</p>
<p>Cons net 0.467 vs 0.129</p>
<p>Operating result 1.197 vs 0.664</p>
<p>Turnover 22.1 vs 11.574</p>
<p>Note - Somague SGPS is a Portuguese construction holding.</p>
<p>-- Lisbon newsroom 351-1-3538254</p>
